  "notes": "A sweet cupcake, not a high-protein dish (about 3 g protein each). No speech, only captions, and no amounts are shown, so all amounts are guesses (~). Syrup boil time, whether the cooker has water/gasket/whistle, and the 20 min flame are only partly clear (caption says bake 20 min on low flame, lid on, steamer plate inside). Makes about 5 (4 paper cups plus 1 steel katori). The vanilla is a small extra, marked optional. No egg is used or shown."
